		(uuid "0a68a1dd-8a56-5f24-924d-35a9344482b7")
	)
	(text "USB_VBUS = connector raw 5V; VDD_5V = switched system 5V.\nCC1 / CC2 each have an independent 5.1k Rd."
		(at 14 155 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "675f8441-3fd7-5687-848f-d8f30ad64e0f")
	)
	(text "ON RC: 100k / 100nF; CT: 100pF C0G. 5V tR approx 0.425ms.\nMeasure CP_VDD rise to 2.7V <=1ms and USB hot-plug current."
		(at 214 164 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b7a8b83c-da15-5837-8591-7f7d27e1dbb2")
	)
	(text "OE permanently enabled; GPIO27 pulled low at reset.\nD1: Worldsemi WS2812B-V5/W. Series 33 ohm near buffer."
		(at 419 152 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2ed19e08-63e5-5d90-8380-1e23b98fdd42")
	)
	(text "CP2102 internal 3.3V is CP_VDD, with C18 local bypass.\nR6 / C7 provide the ESP32 EN reset delay.\nDual NPN DTR/RTS topology retained from the original design."
		(at 14 369 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "986180e0-9e8d-5ccc-ab88-32d55fed6dcf")
	)
	(text "Unused exposed flash / strapping / ADC pins are explicitly NC.\nGPIO32 = SDA; GPIO33 = SCL; GPIO27 = RGB.\nGPIO13/14/15/26 = SD CMD/CLK/CS/DAT0.\nGPIO18/23/2/4/5 = TFT SCK/MOSI/DC/RESET/BL.\nMPU6050: no exposed-pad pin; keep copper/vias/paste out below die."
		(at 214 306 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c3ae4254-a66c-557f-bfed-379aff5005c2")
	)
	(text "MPU6050 address: 0x68 (AD0=GND); INT not used.\nBH1750 address: 0x23 (ADDR=GND). 4.7k I2C pull-ups."
		(at 419 306 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ce643e9c-700c-53d9-a551-d0f85806d744")
	)
	(text "FFC pin order retained. Mate reverses pin numbering.\nGPIO5 low enables the display NMOS / AL5802 backlight stage.\nPins 7=3V3, 8=switched VDD_5V."
		(at 419 370 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "208a0d07-d9b8-5959-8e7d-5eaa2c8e8d3a")
	)
